<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Go on Hello World!</title><link>https://connorzhangyu.com/tags/go/</link><description>Recent content in Go on Hello World!</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>zh</language><lastBuildDate>Thu, 14 Aug 2025 00:00:00 +0000</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://connorzhangyu.com/tags/go/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>Go 的声明语法：为什么与众不同</title><link>https://connorzhangyu.com/featured/go-declaration-syntax/</link><pubDate>Wed, 13 Aug 2025 22:00:00 +0700</pubDate><guid>https://connorzhangyu.com/featured/go-declaration-syntax/</guid><description>&lt;div class="post-authors" style="margin:10px 0 18px;">&lt;div class="author" style="display:inline-flex;align-items:center;margin-right:16px;gap:8px;">&lt;span style="white-space:nowrap;">
 Connor Zhang&lt;span style="margin-left:6px;opacity:.85;">📍 Bangkok, Thailand&lt;/span>&lt;/span>
 &lt;/div>&lt;div class="author-bio" style="margin-top:6px;opacity:.9;">AWS Certified Solutions Architect / 全栈工程师&lt;/div>&lt;/div>
&lt;blockquote>
&lt;p>本文整理自 Go 语言作者 Rob Pike 在 2010 年的文章 &lt;em>&amp;ldquo;Go&amp;rsquo;s Declaration Syntax&amp;rdquo;&lt;/em>，结合原文与实例，解释 Go 为什么采用不同于 C/Java 的声明方式。&lt;br>
写这篇文章的原因：&lt;br>
在网络上能找到不少 &lt;em>&amp;ldquo;Go&amp;rsquo;s Declaration Syntax&amp;rdquo;&lt;/em> 的中文翻译，但大多数存在直译生硬、遗漏原文细节甚至误解语义的问题。&lt;br>
这些低质量翻译往往让读者更困惑，而不是更清楚。&lt;br>
因此，我基于 Rob Pike 原文，结合上下文和代码示例，整理出一份更贴近原意、方便国内开发者理解的版本。&lt;br>
同时保留原文核心思想，并补充了对比表与背景说明，帮助读者更好地掌握 Go 声明语法背后的设计理念。&lt;/p>&lt;/blockquote></description></item><item><title>Go学习路线图v0.1</title><link>https://connorzhangyu.com/docs/project-guides/go-study-plan-v0-1/</link><pubDate>Thu, 14 Aug 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://connorzhangyu.com/docs/project-guides/go-study-plan-v0-1/</guid><description>tosa 东南亚科技小组 Go v0.1 阶段学习路线图，涵盖第一个版本（基础架构）的技术学习与实战安排。</description></item><item><title>tosa后端技术规范与架构规划</title><link>https://connorzhangyu.com/docs/tech-specs/backend-architecture/</link><pubDate>Wed, 13 Aug 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://connorzhangyu.com/docs/tech-specs/backend-architecture/</guid><description>统一后端技术栈与迭代路线，从 MVP 到企业级最佳实践。</description></item><item><title>Go 面试冲刺学习计划（14 天 | 每天 12 小时）</title><link>https://connorzhangyu.com/go-%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95%E5%86%B2%E5%88%BA%E5%AD%A6%E4%B9%A0%E8%AE%A1%E5%88%9214-%E5%A4%A9-%E6%AF%8F%E5%A4%A9-12-%E5%B0%8F%E6%97%B6/</link><pubDate>Fri, 08 Aug 2025 10:00:00 +0700</pubDate><guid>https://connorzhangyu.com/go-%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95%E5%86%B2%E5%88%BA%E5%AD%A6%E4%B9%A0%E8%AE%A1%E5%88%9214-%E5%A4%A9-%E6%AF%8F%E5%A4%A9-12-%E5%B0%8F%E6%97%B6/</guid><description>&lt;blockquote>
